From e0a923dd1e37abf8c66d02e967d3e24ae0374a28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Wang <jimwan@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:04:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] meson.build: use weston 15

QLI 2.0 builds against the oe-core Weston 15 recipe, which provides
libweston-15.pc and installs modules under libweston-15.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Jim Wang <jimwan@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 meson.build | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index e2a04e7..8ad5360 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -14 +14 @@
-libweston_major = 13
+libweston_major = 15
@@ -111 +111 @@
-dep_libweston = dependency('libweston-13')
+dep_libweston = dependency('libweston-15')
-- 
2.34.1
